NextStudio AI Model Notice
==========================

Model: MGM_MAIN_v4
Upstream project: Ultimate Vocal Remover GUI
Upstream repository:
https://github.com/Anjok07/ultimatevocalremovergui
Official model registry:
https://github.com/Anjok07/ultimatevocalremovergui/blob/master/gui_data/model_manual_download.json
Original architecture:
https://github.com/tsurumeso/vocal-remover

The TensorFlow.js files distributed with NextStudio contain an FP16-quantized
conversion of the MGM_MAIN_v4 model. NextStudio is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the upstream authors.

Original MGM_MAIN_v4.pth fingerprints:
SHA-256: 0e6f0c0592333a3b215f61ac1e01f6c24c059f903f0789cf634e92daffae1dce
UVR model-hash (MD5 of the final 10 MiB):
5a6e24c1b530f2dab045a522ef89b751

Distributed TensorFlow.js artifact fingerprints:
model.json SHA-256:
4bbf00c984124db90a5d1add0eb438516180acec2c555d939dff7de897f0c922
group1-shard1of1.bin SHA-256:
d15138d4eedc24664a266fdd43ff3bbc3eeb6c281ac79c00be0e80a28c3d6f08

